{1}{Greetings mortal. I've watched you as you've adventured across the land,I have even traded goods with you  and I have a deal for you.}{Greetings mortal. I've watched you as you've adventured across the land,I have even traded goods with you  and I have a deal for you.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{NO! No more deals, no more quests. I've had enough!}{}{1}{}{}{co}
{3}{I'm listening...}{}{1}{}{4}{}
{4}{People have abandoned the old gods, especially with this Panarii stuff being the "in thing" now. I want to bring their beliefs back to me.}{People have abandoned the old gods, especially with this Panarii stuff being the "in thing" now. I want to bring their beliefs back to me.}{}{}{}{}
{5}{But I like the Panarii beliefs.}{}{1}{}{7}{re-5}
